# Base URL of the image-proxy Worker (src/worker/image-proxy.ts), which holds
# the Unsplash API key server-side. Not a secret — it ships in the bundle.
#
# Leave it empty and the app degrades to no photo picker: Surprise me and
# Blank puzzle still work.
#
# For local dev, put the deployed Worker's URL — currently
# https://puzzle-image-proxy.stealmycode.workers.dev — in .env.local. Left
# empty here so a build without that setup degrades to no picker rather than
# silently pointing a fork at this project's Worker.
#
# To run the Worker locally instead, put the Unsplash key in .dev.vars at the
# repo root (gitignored — it must never be committed):
#     UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY=...
# then `npx wrangler dev` and point VITE_IMAGE_PROXY_URL at
# http://localhost:8787. Without .dev.vars the local Worker answers
# "Proxy not configured" with a 500 on every request.
#
# The Unsplash key itself is NOT set here any more. It lives in Cloudflare:
#     npx wrangler secret put UNSPLASH_ACCESS_KEY
VITE_IMAGE_PROXY_URL=
